  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_c6eb1764-b109-4e95-9ba2-9d0621f0e64b.png\"></p>\n<p>這是一個模組庫！如果你不是開發者，請不用擔心。它很可能只是作為其他模組的依賴項而出現在你的整合包中。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_2158d9d6-4a3c-4bff-9dd9-81061aab7627.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/TxniLib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104882/description_410fddf2-ea88-4b14-90b3-e867e93d9ac3.png\"></p>\n<p>如果你是開發者，你好！這個模組庫是專門為配合我的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftemplate.txni.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">多版本模板模組</a>而設計的，我使用它從單一程式碼庫同時在 Forge 和 Fabric 上發布 1.20 與 1.21 的模組。除了我個人覺得實用的隨機功能外，這個模組主要包含針對不同平台與版本的實作，旨在減少在多版本專案維護時重複撰寫 if/else 條件的次數。歡迎使用，但文件僅視我空閒時間而定。</p>",
